-- title:
--   Original stopped HJB expected dividend bound from a cofinal source subsequence and asymptotic Stieltjes correction
-- statement:
--   For the original spectrally negative Levy X, admissible dividend D, original ruin, and bounded right-continuous tau, derive the full stopped expected terminal-plus-cash and nested ENNReal dividend bounds from a common deterministic cofinal subsequence along which the genuine original stopped source grid converges almost surely and the complete actual dividend Stieltjes residual is asymptotically dominated by H+epsilon. The source M is integrable and centred and E[G+H]<=0. Retain BV C1/UBV C2, w(0)>=0, rightLimit terminal, q>0 and exact source filtration. This weakens the previously Proved full-grid expected-budget source limit without postulating the missing stochastic decomposition.
-- source:
--   Avram, Palmowski and Pistorius Proposition 4(i), Eqs. (5.11)-(5.13); non-stochastic bridge importing Proved 8eb288ef and expected HJB budget fa804c20.

